# Firebase secrets
# NOTE: firebase_options.dart and firebase.json are safe to commit —
# Firebase Android API keys are not secrets, they're protected by
# Firestore security rules. google-services.json contains the same keys
# but we keep it uncommitted so each dev downloads a fresh one from
# the console and we don't have to rotate on repo access changes.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
.firebaserc

